---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — Shivrudh International" description="Shivrudh International is a Tamil Nadu based trading company exporting jasmine, turmeric and quality spices, sourced directly from growers.">
  <section class="border-b border-spice-100 bg-spice-800 text-cream-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold">About Shivrudh International</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-cream-200">
        A trading company built on a simple idea &mdash; connect the quality of
        Tamil Nadu&rsquo;s farms with buyers who value it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-spice-700">
      <p>
        Shivrudh International is a Tamil Nadu based trading company specialising
        in the export of spices and agricultural produce. We started with the
        products our region is famous for &mdash; the fragrant Madurai jasmine
        and the vivid, high-curcumin turmeric of Erode &mdash; and we continue to
        grow our range around what our buyers ask for.
      </p>
      <p>
        As traders, our value is in sourcing and reliability. We work close to
        farmer clusters and mandis, select and grade for export, and manage
        packaging, documentation and logistics so that ordering from India feels
        straightforward, wherever you are.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you are a spice packer, a food manufacturer, a fragrance house or
        a distributor, we aim to be the supplier you can rely on for consistent
        quality and honest communication.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-spice-100 bg-spice-50 p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl">🌿</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-spice-800">Sourced at origin</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-spice-600">Direct from Tamil Nadu growers</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-spice-100 bg-spice-50 p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl">✅</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-spice-800">Export graded</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-spice-600">Cleaned, sorted, tested</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-spice-100 bg-spice-50 p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl">🤝</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-spice-800">Buyer first</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-spice-600">Flexible terms &amp; clear comms</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-3xl bg-spice-800 px-8 py-12 text-center text-cream-50">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold">Let&rsquo;s work together</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-lg text-cream-200">
        Tell us what you need and we&rsquo;ll take it from there.
      </p>
      <a href="/quote" class="mt-6 inline-block rounded-lg bg-gold-500 px-7 py-3 font-semibold text-spice-900 transition hover:bg-gold-400">
        Request a Quote
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
